        "explain": "Two staff for four hours is 8 hours of work gone: 12 instead of 20. With fewer resources the café can make less of both, so the whole curve shifts inward.",
        "illustrate": 8,
        "param": "h",
      },
      "say": "Two of the five staff call in sick on Saturday morning.

What changes, and which way?",
      "set": {
